JPEG codec (crates/core/src/jpeg/)
----------------------------------
The baseline JPEG decoder and encoder reproduce libjpeg-turbo's default code
paths bit-exactly (integer IDCT/FDCT, fancy upsampling, colour conversion,
downsampling and quantization) so that re-encoded tiles are byte-identical to
Pillow's output. Those algorithms follow the corresponding libjpeg-turbo
sources (jidctint.c, jfdctint.c, jdsample.c, jdcolor.c, jccolor.c,
jcsample.c, jcdctmgr.c), which are distributed under the IJG License.

This software is based in part on the work of the Independent JPEG Group.

